1
00:00:47,799 --> 00:00:48,159
Cao Jun.

2
00:00:48,159 --> 00:00:49,079
What are you up to, Jun?

3
00:00:49,640 --> 00:00:50,240
What's going on?

4
00:00:50,280 --> 00:00:51,079
Oh, it's nothing.

5
00:00:51,079 --> 00:00:52,079
I'm... I'm washing the vegetables.

6
00:00:52,439 --> 00:00:53,920
Hurry up and wrap these dumplings.

7
00:00:53,920 --> 00:00:54,759
*Hold My Hand* is about to start.

8
00:00:54,759 --> 00:00:55,399
I'm going inside to watch it.

9
00:00:55,399 --> 00:00:56,320
All right, okay.

10
00:01:00,159 --> 00:01:01,759
I heard Cao Jun's wife came back.

11
00:01:01,880 --> 00:01:03,079
Haven't they been divorced for years?

12
00:01:03,399 --> 00:01:05,239
The guy she was with later sold fake medicine.

13
00:01:05,239 --> 00:01:06,159
He ended up getting arrested.

14
00:01:06,159 --> 00:01:08,079
Now she's back and insists on staying here.

15
00:01:08,560 --> 00:01:09,239
Tell me,

16
00:01:09,719 --> 00:01:11,319
isn't that taking advantage of an honest guy?

17
00:01:11,879 --> 00:01:12,480
Can you believe that?

18
00:03:04,159 --> 00:03:05,479
Leaving whenever they want,

19
00:03:06,560 --> 00:03:08,599
coming back whenever they want.

20
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:11,960
Every single one of them.

21
00:03:12,080 --> 00:03:13,560
How can they be so shameless?

22
00:03:13,639 --> 00:03:14,919
So damn unreliable.

23
00:03:49,919 --> 00:03:52,800
Drifting toward me, I listen closely.

24
00:03:53,919 --> 00:03:55,000
What's wrong, girl?

25
00:03:58,639 --> 00:03:59,680
Are you crying?

26
00:04:00,319 --> 00:04:01,680
Why so unhappy?

27
00:04:01,840 --> 00:04:02,560
What?

28
00:04:03,960 --> 00:04:05,000
You're happy, huh?

29
00:04:05,680 --> 00:04:06,800
What's there to be sad about?

30
00:04:07,319 --> 00:04:08,199
Talk to me. Come on.

31
00:04:12,120 --> 00:04:12,879
Have some sunflower seeds.

32
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:13,560
Come on, here.

33
00:04:13,680 --> 00:04:14,159
Got some right here.

34
00:04:14,199 --> 00:04:14,680
Wait.

35
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:16,959
Don't, don't spill them.

36
00:04:17,600 --> 00:04:18,279
Have some. Eat up.

37
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:19,759
They're so good.

38
00:04:20,439 --> 00:04:21,480
Sunflower seeds will cheer you right up.

39
00:04:25,759 --> 00:04:27,079
Watch where you're spitting!

40
00:04:36,120 --> 00:04:37,920
Five champions!

41
00:04:38,480 --> 00:04:39,199
You dummy.

42
00:04:40,560 --> 00:04:41,319
Can you do it?

43
00:04:43,120 --> 00:04:44,439
I've got sixes!

44
00:04:45,399 --> 00:04:46,600
Sixes work too.

45
00:04:47,199 --> 00:04:47,639
Can you do it?

46
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:49,920
You're so silly.

47
00:04:49,920 --> 00:04:50,639
Eight Horses!

48
00:04:51,040 --> 00:04:51,519
Beats yours!

49
00:04:51,720 --> 00:04:52,360
Eight Horses!

50
00:04:53,959 --> 00:04:54,600
Eight Horses!

51
00:04:55,120 --> 00:04:55,800
Eight Horses works too.

52
00:04:56,199 --> 00:04:56,560
How's that?

53
00:04:59,959 --> 00:05:01,160
Bang, you're dead.

54
00:05:01,439 --> 00:05:02,199
Hitting me now?

55
00:05:02,560 --> 00:05:03,519
I'll hit you!

56
00:05:03,519 --> 00:05:04,079
So what?

57
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:05,240
Fine, you can hit me later.

58
00:05:05,759 --> 00:05:06,639
Hey, um...

59
00:05:07,759 --> 00:05:08,560
It's too cold out here.

60
00:05:09,279 --> 00:05:09,839
Let's go.

61
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:11,879
Where to?

62
00:05:12,160 --> 00:05:13,319
Go grab a drink, obviously.

63
00:05:15,560 --> 00:05:16,480
What is there to think about?

64
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:16,879
Let's go.

65
00:05:17,040 --> 00:05:17,920
Let's go have a drink.

66
00:05:18,600 --> 00:05:19,040
Alright, alright, alright.

67
00:05:19,079 --> 00:05:19,480
Let's go.

68
00:05:28,800 --> 00:05:29,519
Tu Chunyan.

69
00:05:36,040 --> 00:05:36,759
Tu Chunyan.

70
00:05:39,480 --> 00:05:40,199
Tu Chunyan.

71
00:05:56,800 --> 00:05:58,040
Who on earth

72
00:05:58,560 --> 00:05:59,680
wants to kill Qian Yichuan?

73
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:05,439
Look at your slight build.

74
00:06:05,439 --> 00:06:06,800
Carrying such heavy gear every day.

75
00:06:06,800 --> 00:06:08,040
How about I film for you?

76
00:06:08,319 --> 00:06:08,920
Teach me.

77
00:06:09,279 --> 00:06:10,279
Why do you want to learn this?

78
00:06:11,560 --> 00:06:11,959
How about this:

79
00:06:12,360 --> 00:06:13,839
Fi-film me instead.

80
00:06:14,319 --> 00:06:14,839
What do you say?

81
00:06:15,040 --> 00:06:15,920
I... I want to...

82
00:06:16,360 --> 00:06:17,800
say a few words today.

83
00:06:18,279 --> 00:06:19,000
Speak my mind.

84
00:06:19,600 --> 00:06:20,040
All right.

85
00:06:25,160 --> 00:06:26,120
Let me say a few words.

86
00:06:29,319 --> 00:06:30,360
What are you filming here?

87
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:31,959
Put that thing away.

88
00:06:32,399 --> 00:06:33,000
Leizi.

89
00:06:33,920 --> 00:06:34,519
Who's he?

90
00:06:35,120 --> 00:06:36,160
He's related to the factory director.

91
00:06:38,480 --> 00:06:39,279
Don't you understand me?

92
00:06:39,319 --> 00:06:39,879
I'll smash it to pieces!

93
00:06:40,360 --> 00:06:40,759
Leizi, Leizi, Leizi!

94
00:06:40,759 --> 00:06:41,720
Why can't I film?

95
00:06:41,759 --> 00:06:42,279
Leizi, Leizi!

96
00:06:42,319 --> 00:06:43,160
She's a TV reporter.

97
00:06:43,199 --> 00:06:43,720
Zhao Haipeng,

98
00:06:43,800 --> 00:06:44,800
this has nothing to do with you!

99
00:06:44,839 --> 00:06:45,560
No, listen to me...

100
00:06:45,720 --> 00:06:46,720
Listen to you? I...

101
00:06:46,720 --> 00:06:47,720
Listen to you? Beat him up, Leizi!

102
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:48,360
Smash it!

103
00:06:50,240 --> 00:06:50,759
What are you doing?!

104
00:06:50,759 --> 00:06:51,199
Smash it!

105
00:06:51,199 --> 00:06:51,920
Over here, smash it!

106
00:06:58,240 --> 00:06:58,639
Give it to me!

107
00:06:58,639 --> 00:06:59,079
Still fighting back?

108
00:06:59,079 --> 00:06:59,600
Give it to me!

109
00:07:07,720 --> 00:07:09,120
Get him, all of you!

110
00:07:19,839 --> 00:07:20,279
After him!

111
00:07:20,279 --> 00:07:20,959
Get him!

112
00:07:22,079 --> 00:07:22,720
Catch him!

113
00:07:23,279 --> 00:07:23,920
Catch who?

114
00:07:23,920 --> 00:07:24,439
Him!

115
00:07:25,360 --> 00:07:25,959
Grab him!

116
00:07:27,879 --> 00:07:28,480
Get him!

117
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:30,360
Bro! Bro!

118
00:07:30,360 --> 00:07:30,800
Hold him!

119
00:07:31,120 --> 00:07:32,279
Why'd you hit my face?

120
00:07:32,279 --> 00:07:33,160
Don't run!

121
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:43,040
Over here! Over here!

122
00:07:44,879 --> 00:07:45,439
Tieping!

123
00:07:46,319 --> 00:07:46,879
Stop filming!

124
00:07:47,079 --> 00:07:47,839
Go get backup!

125
00:07:49,560 --> 00:07:50,279
Hurry and call someone!

126
00:07:50,920 --> 00:07:51,920
Find Cheng Youtian!

127
00:08:05,639 --> 00:08:06,560
You dare hit me?!

128
00:08:08,319 --> 00:08:08,959
Hit me, huh?!

129
00:08:11,680 --> 00:08:12,439
Stay out of this!

130
00:08:12,439 --> 00:08:13,199
What are you doing?!

131
00:08:13,360 --> 00:08:13,959
Stay back!

132
00:08:15,480 --> 00:08:15,920
Careful!

133
00:08:16,399 --> 00:08:16,959
Boys!

134
00:08:17,959 --> 00:08:18,560
Grab him!

135
00:08:19,120 --> 00:08:19,839
Hold him down!

136
00:08:23,759 --> 00:08:24,519
Beat him up!

137
00:08:24,519 --> 00:08:25,720
Beat him! Are you okay?

138
00:08:25,759 --> 00:08:26,120
I'm fine.

139
00:08:26,959 --> 00:08:27,639
Beat him up!

140
00:08:28,120 --> 00:08:29,120
His head is injured!

141
00:08:29,120 --> 00:08:30,120
Beat him up!

142
00:08:30,439 --> 00:08:31,279
Beat the hell out of him!

143
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:33,360
His head is injured!

144
00:08:35,240 --> 00:08:36,440
Tieping, are you okay?

145
00:08:36,639 --> 00:08:37,279
Hurry up!

146
00:08:38,320 --> 00:08:38,960
Director!

147
00:08:42,480 --> 00:08:43,080
Are you okay?

148
00:08:43,360 --> 00:08:43,960
Hang in there!

149
00:08:45,679 --> 00:08:46,840
Haipeng, are you okay?

150
00:08:46,840 --> 00:08:47,399
I'm fine.

151
00:08:48,200 --> 00:08:49,600
Come on, to the clinic!

152
00:08:49,679 --> 00:08:50,320
Go to the clinic!

153
00:08:51,039 --> 00:08:51,440
Let's go!

154
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:52,639
Move!

155
00:08:52,759 --> 00:08:54,039
Move, move!

156
00:08:54,399 --> 00:08:55,039
Let's go!

157
00:09:21,639 --> 00:09:22,240
Let's talk inside.

158
00:09:29,320 --> 00:09:30,240
Qian Yichuan is dead.

159
00:09:31,720 --> 00:09:33,120
Tu Chunyan's fate is unknown.

160
00:09:33,879 --> 00:09:34,519
And apparently,

161
00:09:35,039 --> 00:09:36,120
there was a cop too?

162
00:09:36,639 --> 00:09:37,279
Critically injured.

163
00:09:38,240 --> 00:09:38,879
I know.

164
00:09:40,200 --> 00:09:41,039
I was there.

165
00:09:41,519 --> 00:09:42,799
You were there?

166
00:09:43,639 --> 00:09:44,720
It's an ongoing case,

167
00:09:45,120 --> 00:09:46,039
the police won't let me talk.

168
00:09:46,440 --> 00:09:47,320
You're right.

169
00:09:47,320 --> 00:09:48,759
Death is getting closer to us.

170
00:09:50,080 --> 00:09:51,120
Who knows which day,

171
00:09:51,639 --> 00:09:52,399
which one of us,

172
00:09:53,440 --> 00:09:54,360
will suddenly just be gone.

173
00:10:06,120 --> 00:10:06,679
Leshui,

174
00:10:08,799 --> 00:10:09,480
I'm begging you.

175
00:10:10,879 --> 00:10:11,960
Get out of here right now.

176
00:10:14,279 --> 00:10:15,360
Take your mom with you.

177
00:10:16,200 --> 00:10:17,399
Better take Lili along too.

178
00:10:17,960 --> 00:10:19,399
I'm terrified if the killer comes knocking...

179
00:10:19,399 --> 00:10:20,120
It's... it's...

180
00:10:20,639 --> 00:10:21,159
There's just...

181
00:10:21,159 --> 00:10:22,240
no way to guard against it!

182
00:10:23,840 --> 00:10:24,600
Who do you think

183
00:10:25,759 --> 00:10:26,799
the killer is?

184
00:10:32,639 --> 00:10:33,600
How would I know?

185
00:10:39,720 --> 00:10:40,559
That's the third one.

186
00:10:41,919 --> 00:10:43,559
The killer is declaring war on us.

187
00:10:44,240 --> 00:10:45,120
Three lives lost.

188
00:10:45,720 --> 00:10:46,639
This is a major case, everyone.

189
00:10:47,320 --> 00:10:48,480
The provincial leaders take this very seriously.

190
00:10:49,080 --> 00:10:50,080
The municipal bureau set up a task force.

191
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:51,559
Our specific task

192
00:10:51,960 --> 00:10:53,559
is to summarize last night's situation,

193
00:10:53,799 --> 00:10:55,759
connect and analyze all three murders,

194
00:10:56,120 --> 00:10:56,720
and investigate them as a linked series.

195
00:10:58,039 --> 00:10:58,559
Gao,

196
00:10:59,360 --> 00:11:00,559
tell us about last night.

197
00:11:00,879 --> 00:11:03,720
Yesterday's crime scene was at the old factory area.

198
00:11:04,399 --> 00:11:05,519
There are no surveillance cameras there,

199
00:11:05,519 --> 00:11:07,519
but we recovered footprints at the scene.

200
00:11:07,960 --> 00:11:08,960
Besides Chuang's,

201
00:11:09,159 --> 00:11:10,000
Tu Chunyan's,

202
00:11:10,200 --> 00:11:11,080
and Qian Yichuan's,

203
00:11:11,159 --> 00:11:12,519
there's an unidentified one.

204
00:11:13,480 --> 00:11:14,480
These footprints,

205
00:11:14,919 --> 00:11:15,879
after our examination,

206
00:11:15,879 --> 00:11:17,759
belong to Feiyun-brand snow boots.

207
00:11:18,080 --> 00:11:19,159
The shoe size is 45.

208
00:11:19,480 --> 00:11:20,399
Wu, how tall are you?

209
00:11:21,519 --> 00:11:22,120
189 cm.

210
00:11:22,759 --> 00:11:23,720
What size shoe do you wear?

211
00:11:24,039 --> 00:11:24,720
Size 45.

212
00:11:24,960 --> 00:11:25,600
Size 45.

213
00:11:26,240 --> 00:11:27,200
So right now,

214
00:11:27,200 --> 00:11:29,639
we estimate the person who left these prints

215
00:11:29,639 --> 00:11:31,759
is around 185 to 195 cm tall,

216
00:11:32,120 --> 00:11:33,840
and weighs over 95 kg.

217
00:11:35,120 --> 00:11:37,080
His footprints lead from the malt silo

218
00:11:37,120 --> 00:11:39,320
all the way to the highway, where they vanish.

219
00:11:39,919 --> 00:11:41,759
The second lead is a video taken by

220
00:11:41,919 --> 00:11:43,720
reporter Shen Leshui at the crime scene.

221
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:44,720
Take a look, everyone.

222
00:11:47,960 --> 00:11:49,840
From this video, we can see

223
00:11:50,240 --> 00:11:51,799
the person seen from behind

224
00:11:52,200 --> 00:11:52,879
is very agile.

225
00:11:53,240 --> 00:11:54,240
It's a male,

226
00:11:54,399 --> 00:11:56,080
who definitely works out.

227
00:11:56,480 --> 00:11:58,679
Moreover, the footprints where it was filmed

228
00:11:59,080 --> 00:12:01,440
match the footprints found at the crime scene.

229
00:12:02,159 --> 00:12:03,600
So we can preliminarily determine

230
00:12:03,720 --> 00:12:05,320
that the person in this video is the killer.

231
00:12:05,720 --> 00:12:07,080
Another piece of information is,

232
00:12:07,200 --> 00:12:08,039
from what we know,

233
00:12:08,039 --> 00:12:10,120
no one has visited

234
00:12:10,120 --> 00:12:11,080
this abandoned factory for a long time.

235
00:12:11,320 --> 00:12:13,279
It's usually kept locked,

236
00:12:13,559 --> 00:12:15,279
and the key was with Qian Yichuan.

237
00:12:15,559 --> 00:12:17,039
For him to run from the malt silo

238
00:12:17,480 --> 00:12:19,759
to the highway so quickly

239
00:12:20,240 --> 00:12:22,919
proves he's extremely familiar with the area.

240
00:12:23,559 --> 00:12:24,720
So my suggestion is

241
00:12:24,799 --> 00:12:27,960
we prioritize screening male brewery employees.

242
00:12:28,200 --> 00:12:30,000
Anyone matching the criteria I just mentioned

243
00:12:30,039 --> 00:12:31,240
should be our primary focus.

244
00:12:31,960 --> 00:12:33,360
When we found the bodies

245
00:12:33,519 --> 00:12:34,600
of Ma Guowen and Cao Jun,

246
00:12:35,399 --> 00:12:36,200
both of their heads

247
00:12:36,600 --> 00:12:38,679
were covered with identical black plastic bags.

248
00:12:39,360 --> 00:12:41,000
And Qian Yichuan, who fell to his death,

249
00:12:41,320 --> 00:12:41,840
was the same.

250
00:12:42,759 --> 00:12:43,279
Meanwhile,

251
00:12:43,720 --> 00:12:44,679
beside them,

252
00:12:45,200 --> 00:12:46,000
we also discovered

253
00:12:46,200 --> 00:12:47,080
identical

254
00:12:47,639 --> 00:12:49,000
bottle caps from Lapi Brewery.

255
00:12:50,080 --> 00:12:51,200
That can't be a coincidence.

256
00:12:54,120 --> 00:12:55,919
The victims didn't lose any valuables.

257
00:12:56,559 --> 00:12:57,399
On the surface,

258
00:12:57,759 --> 00:12:59,480
we can basically rule out murder for money.

259
00:13:00,320 --> 00:13:01,720
That makes the likelihood of revenge killing

260
00:13:02,159 --> 00:13:02,919
all the more apparent.

261
00:13:03,440 --> 00:13:04,960
Analyzing the evidence collected from the scene

262
00:13:05,559 --> 00:13:07,240
and the circumstances of the three victims,

263
00:13:07,759 --> 00:13:08,519
I personally think

264
00:13:09,159 --> 00:13:10,879
we can't rule out a serial killer.

265
00:13:12,159 --> 00:13:14,039
Based on our current findings

266
00:13:14,559 --> 00:13:15,360
and the preliminary assessment

267
00:13:15,679 --> 00:13:16,639
from forensics,

268
00:13:17,200 --> 00:13:18,320
before we get further leads

269
00:13:18,600 --> 00:13:19,440
and evidence,

270
00:13:20,120 --> 00:13:21,080
our priority

271
00:13:21,639 --> 00:13:22,759
is to thoroughly investigate

272
00:13:23,000 --> 00:13:24,799
all social connections tied to the three victims.

273
00:13:25,720 --> 00:13:26,440
Let me emphasize one thing:

274
00:13:26,720 --> 00:13:27,440
be thorough.

275
00:13:28,320 --> 00:13:29,679
Don't let a single clue slip through the cracks.

276
00:13:39,919 --> 00:13:40,519
You're here.

277
00:13:40,879 --> 00:13:41,559
Master, you're here.

278
00:13:42,000 --> 00:13:42,639
Lock the door.

279
00:13:42,879 --> 00:13:43,399
Locked.

280
00:13:43,559 --> 00:13:44,000
It's locked.

281
00:13:44,480 --> 00:13:44,840
Quick.

282
00:13:45,639 --> 00:13:46,159
Come inside.

283
00:13:46,399 --> 00:13:46,960
Hurry, hurry.

284
00:13:52,559 --> 00:13:53,440
Sit down, sit down.

285
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:00,960
Everyone's here.

286
00:14:01,960 --> 00:14:03,759
Of course we are. We're all that's left.

287
00:14:06,519 --> 00:14:07,879
I wonder if Xiao Tu has woken up yet.

288
00:14:09,320 --> 00:14:10,080
No idea.

289
00:14:10,120 --> 00:14:11,639
I texted her, but she didn't reply.

290
00:14:12,360 --> 00:14:13,039
I did too.

291
00:14:13,440 --> 00:14:14,399
She didn't reply to me either.

292
00:14:16,080 --> 00:14:17,120
I just hope Xiao Tu...

293
00:14:17,320 --> 00:14:18,519
...can pull through this.

294
00:14:19,519 --> 00:14:21,440
She was with Qian Yichuan for so many years,

295
00:14:21,600 --> 00:14:22,399
through thick and thin.

296
00:14:23,200 --> 00:14:25,320
She won't be able to take this.

297
00:14:25,440 --> 00:14:25,960
Yeah.

298
00:14:26,600 --> 00:14:28,320
So even if she wakes up,

299
00:14:29,919 --> 00:14:31,639
there's another hurdle waiting for her.

300
00:14:33,600 --> 00:14:34,519
This morning,

301
00:14:35,360 --> 00:14:36,919
Tieping and I went to bring her chicken soup.

302
00:14:37,519 --> 00:14:38,519
The police guarded the door.

303
00:14:39,120 --> 00:14:39,960
They wouldn't let anyone in.

304
00:14:40,440 --> 00:14:41,200
Well, of course.

305
00:14:44,080 --> 00:14:45,600
We used to have a whole room of people,

306
00:14:46,480 --> 00:14:48,000
and now only a few of us are left.

307
00:14:48,320 --> 00:14:49,759
May good people stay safe and sound.

308
00:14:50,440 --> 00:14:51,639
Cao Jun was a good man, right?

309
00:14:52,759 --> 00:14:54,240
And Qian Yichuan wasn't that bad either, was he?

310
00:14:55,200 --> 00:14:55,960
Xiao Tu included.

311
00:14:56,399 --> 00:14:57,279
What did she ever do to anyone?

312
00:14:58,120 --> 00:14:58,799
Hold on, hold on.

313
00:14:59,200 --> 00:14:59,960
Today, we...

314
00:15:00,399 --> 00:15:00,960
Yeah?

315
00:15:01,159 --> 00:15:02,799
...didn't come here to talk about who's good.

316
00:15:03,039 --> 00:15:05,120
Aren't we here to figure out who the bad guy is?

317
00:15:08,480 --> 00:15:09,159
Who? Tieping?

318
00:15:10,679 --> 00:15:11,720
You rarely speak up.

319
00:15:11,759 --> 00:15:12,559
Say something.

320
00:15:13,399 --> 00:15:15,120
Tieping isn't good with words.

321
00:15:15,240 --> 00:15:16,480
Just let him speak.

322
00:15:16,639 --> 00:15:17,279
Right.

323
00:15:17,360 --> 00:15:18,919
No, he never talks anyway.

324
00:15:19,240 --> 00:15:19,639
Come on,

325
00:15:19,679 --> 00:15:21,159
just let him say what he feels.

326
00:15:21,159 --> 00:15:22,480
He doesn't like talking.

327
00:15:23,039 --> 00:15:23,720
Do you have any thoughts?

328
00:15:24,440 --> 00:15:25,000
He doesn't—

329
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:25,399
Just—

330
00:15:28,399 --> 00:15:29,080
Someone's coming.

331
00:15:29,440 --> 00:15:29,919
Hide!

332
00:15:30,559 --> 00:15:31,039
Get in the kitchen!

333
00:15:35,960 --> 00:15:36,399
Tieping!

334
00:15:37,759 --> 00:15:38,440
Get in there, quick!

335
00:15:39,879 --> 00:15:40,720
Don't move. Stay still!

336
00:15:59,159 --> 00:15:59,720
Director Cheng,

337
00:16:00,159 --> 00:16:02,240
I went to the old plant to find Qian Yichuan yesterday

338
00:16:02,559 --> 00:16:03,600
and got footage of someone from behind.

339
00:16:04,720 --> 00:16:05,279
Leshui,

340
00:16:05,679 --> 00:16:06,399
what are you doing here?

341
00:16:06,399 --> 00:16:07,600
Weren't you told to stay inside?

342
00:16:08,200 --> 00:16:09,159
Haipeng, you're here too?

343
00:16:10,759 --> 00:16:11,679
You're all here.

344
00:16:13,799 --> 00:16:14,440
That's perfect.

345
00:16:14,879 --> 00:16:16,200
I got footage of someone from behind yesterday.

346
00:16:16,279 --> 00:16:17,840
Take a look and see who this is.

347
00:16:18,360 --> 00:16:18,879
From behind? Who is it?

348
00:16:19,200 --> 00:16:19,799
Whose figure?

349
00:16:19,840 --> 00:16:20,399
Let me see.

350
00:16:26,039 --> 00:16:27,000
It's too blurry.

351
00:16:30,440 --> 00:16:31,399
Right here, look.

352
00:16:36,960 --> 00:16:37,639
Excuse me.

353
00:16:38,600 --> 00:16:39,600
Coming through.

354
00:16:42,840 --> 00:16:43,320
Coming!

355
00:16:47,519 --> 00:16:47,919
Coming!

356
00:16:47,919 --> 00:16:48,559
Master Cheng,

357
00:16:49,039 --> 00:16:49,759
sorry to bother you.

358
00:16:55,600 --> 00:16:56,080
Anyone home?

359
00:16:56,600 --> 00:16:57,080
Who is it?

360
00:16:57,759 --> 00:16:58,320
Who?

361
00:16:58,480 --> 00:16:59,200
Nobody's here.

362
00:16:59,919 --> 00:17:00,519
Nobody.

363
00:17:00,840 --> 00:17:01,639
We're closed today.

364
00:17:04,240 --> 00:17:04,839
Closed today.

365
00:17:05,200 --> 00:17:06,279
I saw by your front door

366
00:17:06,279 --> 00:17:07,759
that there's a "closed" sign hanging.

367
00:17:20,839 --> 00:17:21,680
What are you all doing here?

368
00:17:22,279 --> 00:17:22,799
Just chatting.

369
00:17:23,519 --> 00:17:23,880
Come on out.

370
00:17:32,359 --> 00:17:33,119
Step outside.

371
00:17:34,200 --> 00:17:34,759
What are you afraid of?

372
00:17:35,880 --> 00:17:37,079
Things are pretty chaotic outside, aren't they?

373
00:17:37,759 --> 00:17:38,480
We're scared.

374
00:17:38,720 --> 00:17:39,200
Right.

375
00:17:41,279 --> 00:17:42,240
Reporter Shen is here too.

376
00:17:42,839 --> 00:17:43,279
What brings you here?

377
00:17:43,599 --> 00:17:44,200
Here for a drink?

378
00:17:45,000 --> 00:17:46,319
Are you here for a drink too, Officer Gao?

379
00:17:46,880 --> 00:17:47,480
Official business.

380
00:17:48,720 --> 00:17:49,200
What about you?

381
00:17:50,200 --> 00:17:51,359
Just catching up with an old friend.

382
00:17:52,519 --> 00:17:53,400
Chatting is fine.

383
00:17:54,039 --> 00:17:55,240
Just don't leak details about the case.

384
00:17:55,640 --> 00:17:56,559
We're running a police investigation.

385
00:17:56,559 --> 00:17:57,559
If you obstruct it,

386
00:17:57,559 --> 00:17:58,480
you'll be held liable.

387
00:18:00,160 --> 00:18:00,720
Of course not.

388
00:18:01,240 --> 00:18:01,759
Not at all.

389
00:18:03,480 --> 00:18:04,599
Just catching up with an old friend.

390
00:18:05,039 --> 00:18:05,640
Right, we're just...

391
00:18:05,640 --> 00:18:06,400
...just chatting.

392
00:18:07,359 --> 00:18:08,640
Would you mind giving us a moment?

393
00:18:11,680 --> 00:18:12,240
Sure.

394
00:18:13,319 --> 00:18:14,279
I'll take off then.

395
00:18:15,039 --> 00:18:15,680
Take care, everyone.

396
00:18:20,799 --> 00:18:21,279
Watch your step.

397
00:18:26,440 --> 00:18:28,319
Look at you, why aren't you wearing a hard hat?

398
00:18:28,680 --> 00:18:29,119
I'll walk her out.

399
00:18:29,200 --> 00:18:29,759
No need.

400
00:18:30,079 --> 00:18:30,640
In broad daylight?

401
00:18:30,640 --> 00:18:31,160
What's there to fear?

402
00:18:31,240 --> 00:18:31,920
She can walk on her own. I have to go...

403
00:18:31,920 --> 00:18:33,079
...pick up my grandson.

404
00:18:33,480 --> 00:18:34,160
What's the rush?

405
00:18:34,160 --> 00:18:34,559
No, no...

406
00:18:34,559 --> 00:18:35,119
Your grandson isn't in a rush.

407
00:18:35,119 --> 00:18:35,559
I am.

408
00:18:35,640 --> 00:18:36,160
Please have a seat.

409
00:18:36,200 --> 00:18:37,119
Come on, sit.

410
00:18:37,839 --> 00:18:38,640
Where are you going?

411
00:18:38,960 --> 00:18:39,559
To lock the door.

412
00:18:39,920 --> 00:18:40,400
Why lock the door?

413
00:18:40,400 --> 00:18:41,400
You've got the "Closed" sign up.

414
00:18:41,400 --> 00:18:41,839
No one's coming.

415
00:18:42,000 --> 00:18:42,319
Sit.

416
00:18:47,440 --> 00:18:48,359
Have a seat, come on.

417
00:19:01,599 --> 00:19:02,359
Just routine questioning.

418
00:19:03,000 --> 00:19:03,720
No need to be nervous.

419
00:19:05,279 --> 00:19:05,920
I'm not.

420
00:19:15,160 --> 00:19:17,279
When was the last time you saw Qian Yichuan?

421
00:19:18,599 --> 00:19:20,480
The day I was drinking here with him.

422
00:19:22,160 --> 00:19:23,480
The day after he got jumped,

423
00:19:24,440 --> 00:19:25,119
me,

424
00:19:26,039 --> 00:19:27,559
Haipeng, and Tieping—

425
00:19:27,759 --> 00:19:28,799
we went to the hospital to see him.

426
00:19:29,799 --> 00:19:31,680
Of course I had to visit him.

427
00:19:32,599 --> 00:19:34,000
We started at the brewery together.

428
00:19:34,000 --> 00:19:35,160
We were real close.

429
00:19:37,400 --> 00:19:38,720
At the hospital,

430
00:19:40,039 --> 00:19:40,759
he just kept cussing people out.

431
00:19:41,640 --> 00:19:42,160
Who was he cussing out?

432
00:19:43,039 --> 00:19:44,119
Ma Guowen, who else?

433
00:19:46,200 --> 00:19:47,279
Because of his leg.

434
00:19:47,720 --> 00:19:49,680
Ma Guowen hired guys to break it.

435
00:19:50,839 --> 00:19:52,839
Didn't that Leizi who beat him end up in prison?

436
00:19:53,680 --> 00:19:54,920
Anyway, he had a foul mouth.

437
00:19:55,079 --> 00:19:56,400
I couldn't stand him either way.

438
00:19:59,319 --> 00:20:01,039
Who else did he cuss out besides Ma Guowen?

439
00:20:03,680 --> 00:20:04,680
Liu Xuemei.

440
00:20:07,279 --> 00:20:08,480
He said Liu Xuemei was a traitor.

441
00:20:11,680 --> 00:20:12,680
It was all because of

442
00:20:13,359 --> 00:20:14,759
that auction mess.

443
00:20:17,799 --> 00:20:19,519
They all said Liu Xuemei was a traitor.

444
00:20:19,799 --> 00:20:20,640
They all hated her.

445
00:20:21,160 --> 00:20:21,759
Why?

446
00:20:22,480 --> 00:20:23,400
Back then, Liu Xuemei

447
00:20:23,400 --> 00:20:25,279
represented all of us at the auction.

448
00:20:25,839 --> 00:20:26,720
In the end, she ran off.

449
00:20:29,799 --> 00:20:31,400
Everyone was counting on her.

450
00:20:33,839 --> 00:20:34,680
For some reason,

451
00:20:34,680 --> 00:20:35,759
she got totally wasted.

452
00:20:36,519 --> 00:20:38,160
As a Beer Taster, she didn't usually drink off-duty.

453
00:20:40,240 --> 00:20:42,200
Who was she drinking with on the day of the auction?

454
00:20:43,039 --> 00:20:43,839
No idea.

455
00:20:44,440 --> 00:20:45,119
Don't know.

456
00:20:46,279 --> 00:20:46,920
I don't know.

457
00:20:47,359 --> 00:20:48,200
I really don't know.

458
00:20:57,440 --> 00:20:59,759
"North Street shop reopens after renovation,

459
00:20:59,920 --> 00:21:01,200
lines stretch down the block.

460
00:21:02,039 --> 00:21:02,640
Recently,

461
00:21:02,880 --> 00:21:04,559
our historic shop underwent..."

462
00:21:11,359 --> 00:21:11,880
Nurse,

463
00:21:12,599 --> 00:21:13,720
when will he wake up?

464
00:21:13,920 --> 00:21:15,799
It depends on how he recovers.

465
00:21:16,160 --> 00:21:17,720
It helps to talk to him more.

466
00:21:17,799 --> 00:21:19,119
Read him the newspaper or something.

467
00:21:19,400 --> 00:21:20,480
Just don't be too loud.

468
00:21:20,559 --> 00:21:21,519
Call me if you need anything.

469
00:21:22,039 --> 00:21:22,599
Thank you.

470
00:22:13,200 --> 00:22:14,599
I've watched Malt Kingdom so many times.

471
00:22:16,960 --> 00:22:18,759
Back when the workers pooled money to buy the factory,

472
00:22:19,559 --> 00:22:20,920
you filmed the whole process.

473
00:22:21,240 --> 00:22:22,920
Yet there isn't a single shot of it in the documentary.

474
00:22:26,960 --> 00:22:27,839
My guess is,

475
00:22:28,839 --> 00:22:30,400
Ma Guowen and the TV station back then

476
00:22:30,400 --> 00:22:31,599
put a lot of pressure on you.

477
00:22:34,400 --> 00:22:35,680
But you still have the raw footage.

478
00:22:37,920 --> 00:22:39,960
So I suggest you think back carefully

479
00:22:40,720 --> 00:22:42,440
to see if there are any clues pointing to the killer.

480
00:22:44,720 --> 00:22:46,039
It's been days already.

481
00:22:46,920 --> 00:22:48,319
You guys still haven't found any clues?

482
00:22:50,240 --> 00:22:50,920
Officer Gao.

483
00:22:51,440 --> 00:22:52,680
I was just about to ask you.

484
00:22:56,319 --> 00:22:57,559
"It's confidential,

485
00:22:57,839 --> 00:22:59,160
no comment," right?

486
00:23:02,240 --> 00:23:03,119
Fine.

487
00:23:03,359 --> 00:23:04,319
Let me tell you this.

488
00:23:05,480 --> 00:23:07,640
I'll definitely get to the bottom of this,

489
00:23:08,200 --> 00:23:09,839
whether it's the past or the present.

490
00:23:10,279 --> 00:23:11,200
Until I figure it out,

491
00:23:11,559 --> 00:23:12,759
I'm never leaving Lacheng.

492
00:23:16,920 --> 00:23:17,799
The bad guys...

493
00:23:18,960 --> 00:23:20,200
Not a single one will get away.

494
00:23:20,440 --> 00:23:22,039
Then give me a list of your suspects.

495
00:23:22,599 --> 00:23:23,440
Write them down.

496
00:23:23,880 --> 00:23:24,920
What's the point of just talking?

497
00:23:25,119 --> 00:23:26,519
Isn't shouting slogans just pure bullshit?

498
00:23:27,319 --> 00:23:28,519
Why are you getting so worked up?

499
00:23:29,240 --> 00:23:31,279
Why don't you go find the one who stole the tapes?

500
00:23:41,640 --> 00:23:42,000
Hello?

501
00:23:42,119 --> 00:23:42,920
Cut the act.

502
00:23:46,359 --> 00:23:47,039
I'll be right over.

503
00:23:53,599 --> 00:23:54,920
There are doctors and nurses here.

504
00:23:55,200 --> 00:23:56,640
He can't even open his mouth to speak.

505
00:23:56,759 --> 00:23:57,759
Please leave, reporter.

506
00:24:01,240 --> 00:24:01,680
Excuse me.

507
00:24:02,119 --> 00:24:02,559
Nurse.

508
00:24:02,920 --> 00:24:03,799
Check on bed 19.

509
00:24:04,880 --> 00:24:05,839
Quite the actor.

510
00:24:06,680 --> 00:24:08,039
You're the one who stole the tapes, aren't you?

511
00:24:29,880 --> 00:24:30,519
You're awake.

512
00:24:34,079 --> 00:24:34,920
How are you feeling?

513
00:24:36,400 --> 00:24:36,880
Don't be scared.

514
00:24:36,880 --> 00:24:37,920
You're safe now.

515
00:24:45,279 --> 00:24:46,400
Just a mild concussion,

516
00:24:47,000 --> 00:24:48,759
but your arms and legs are fine.

517
00:24:49,119 --> 00:24:50,880
Once you recover, you'll be back to normal.

518
00:25:01,000 --> 00:25:01,920
Where's Qian Yichuan?

519
00:25:16,640 --> 00:25:17,519
Tell me,

520
00:25:18,799 --> 00:25:21,000
back when I caught Ma Guowen cooking the books,

521
00:25:21,440 --> 00:25:22,880
if I hadn't exposed him

522
00:25:25,640 --> 00:25:27,119
and led everyone to buy the factory,

523
00:25:29,720 --> 00:25:31,000
would things have been different?

524
00:25:35,799 --> 00:25:36,640
What's with you?

525
00:25:38,720 --> 00:25:39,680
Regretting it?

526
00:25:47,960 --> 00:25:48,920
It's all the same, really.

527
00:25:50,799 --> 00:25:51,759
It's just that...

528
00:25:55,079 --> 00:25:56,519
you might have...

529
00:26:11,279 --> 00:26:12,240
Don't be sad.

530
00:26:13,240 --> 00:26:14,119
Get some rest.

531
00:26:27,599 --> 00:26:28,440
It's standard procedure.

532
00:26:28,960 --> 00:26:30,200
We might need to record this.

533
00:26:30,599 --> 00:26:31,359
Do you agree to that?

534
00:26:37,480 --> 00:26:38,759
Think back carefully.

535
00:26:39,240 --> 00:26:40,799
What really happened that night?

536
00:26:43,039 --> 00:26:44,480
We were originally thinking,

537
00:26:44,880 --> 00:26:46,480
before leaving the factory,

538
00:26:46,960 --> 00:26:48,400
to go check out the top of the malt silo.

539
00:26:50,079 --> 00:26:53,440
But Old Qian said he wanted to talk to Shen Leshui.

540
00:26:54,240 --> 00:26:56,680
So he used my phone to call her,

541
00:26:57,799 --> 00:26:59,799
asking to meet at the abandoned plant gate.

542
00:27:02,319 --> 00:27:03,480
While waiting for her,

543
00:27:04,440 --> 00:27:05,640
the two of us went up to the silo top.

544
00:27:06,359 --> 00:27:07,519
Not long after,

545
00:27:09,039 --> 00:27:09,839
all of a sudden,

546
00:27:11,279 --> 00:27:13,680
I felt someone hit me from behind,

547
00:27:15,400 --> 00:27:16,319
and I blacked out.

548
00:27:18,559 --> 00:27:20,400
What did Qian Yichuan want to say to Shen Leshui?

549
00:27:21,960 --> 00:27:22,799
I don't know.

550
00:27:23,359 --> 00:27:24,400
He didn't tell me.

551
00:27:28,279 --> 00:27:29,799
What time was the call made?

552
00:27:30,279 --> 00:27:32,039
What time did you two go up?

553
00:27:33,359 --> 00:27:33,799
And also,

554
00:27:33,799 --> 00:27:36,079
how long after going up did you hear someone come?

555
00:27:37,720 --> 00:27:38,200
Take your time.

556
00:27:38,240 --> 00:27:39,079
Go through them one by one.

557
00:27:39,400 --> 00:27:41,720
I know you're dizzy and feeling awful,

558
00:27:42,240 --> 00:27:43,279
but these details

559
00:27:43,279 --> 00:27:45,200
are crucial to solving the case.

560
00:27:49,319 --> 00:27:50,599
I remember this clearly.

561
00:27:53,880 --> 00:27:55,720
The call was made around six thirty.

562
00:27:56,279 --> 00:27:57,759
We went up to the silo top at seven.

563
00:27:58,759 --> 00:28:01,079
I even specifically checked my watch.

564
00:28:03,319 --> 00:28:05,400
You didn't see what they looked like at all?

565
00:28:07,839 --> 00:28:08,599
No.

566
00:28:13,279 --> 00:28:14,160
What about Qian Yichuan?

567
00:28:14,960 --> 00:28:17,279
Didn't he shout out a name or anything?

568
00:28:18,839 --> 00:28:19,319
No.

569
00:28:20,079 --> 00:28:22,440
After I fell, I had no idea what happened.

570
00:28:25,799 --> 00:28:27,079
From Ma Guowen,

571
00:28:27,759 --> 00:28:28,680
to Cao Jun,

572
00:28:31,720 --> 00:28:32,759
and now Old Qian...

573
00:28:34,039 --> 00:28:36,039
I never thought death would be this close to me.

574
00:28:37,680 --> 00:28:38,960
Who is this person?

575
00:28:40,279 --> 00:28:41,720
Why does he want to kill us?

576
00:28:45,640 --> 00:28:47,680
The killer probably didn't intend to kill you.

577
00:28:49,079 --> 00:28:50,839
Otherwise, you'd have ended up just like Old Qian.

578
00:28:53,960 --> 00:28:56,240
Did Old Qian have bad blood

579
00:28:56,279 --> 00:28:57,559
with anyone at the plant?

580
00:28:58,640 --> 00:29:00,799
Like something festering for over ten years?

581
00:29:02,839 --> 00:29:04,920
Festering for over ten years?

582
00:29:05,519 --> 00:29:07,200
That would have to be Ma Guowen.

583
00:29:08,240 --> 00:29:10,000
But isn't Ma Guowen already dead?

584
00:29:12,640 --> 00:29:14,680
I'm not afraid to tell you guys now.

585
00:29:16,880 --> 00:29:18,400
Right after Ma Guowen died,

586
00:29:19,160 --> 00:29:20,880
I actually suspected Old Qian did it.

587
00:29:22,759 --> 00:29:25,319
If Qian Yichuan killed Ma Guowen,

588
00:29:26,359 --> 00:29:29,559
then who killed him and Cao Jun?

589
00:29:33,680 --> 00:29:35,720
Did he clash with anyone recently?

590
00:29:36,359 --> 00:29:38,119
Tons of people clashed with him.

591
00:29:39,640 --> 00:29:40,960
With that foul mouth of his,

592
00:29:42,319 --> 00:29:43,559
he'd chew out anyone he saw.

593
00:29:44,359 --> 00:29:46,039
I bet everyone had problems with him.

594
00:29:49,839 --> 00:29:51,279
There's someone else who had a major grudge.

595
00:29:52,960 --> 00:29:53,680
Who?

596
00:29:55,119 --> 00:29:55,759
Leizi.

597
00:30:05,000 --> 00:30:06,319
Are you Lei Zhenqiang?

598
00:30:06,880 --> 00:30:07,920
Yes, he's Lei Zhenqiang.

599
00:30:08,920 --> 00:30:10,279
People used to call him Leizi.

600
00:30:10,480 --> 00:30:11,839
Yeah, everyone used to call him Leizi.

601
00:30:13,960 --> 00:30:15,039
How many years has he been like this?

602
00:30:15,799 --> 00:30:18,000
He came down with it about seven or eight years ago.

603
00:30:18,839 --> 00:30:19,400
A brain hemorrhage.

604
00:30:20,319 --> 00:30:20,799
These are the aftereffects.

605
00:30:25,559 --> 00:30:26,519
Come on, brother, Lei.

606
00:30:27,160 --> 00:30:28,799
You're not as cocky as you used to be, huh?

607
00:30:31,359 --> 00:30:32,720
Still, in the end, someone's gotta wait on you.

608
00:30:34,440 --> 00:30:35,319
Want to get out of bed?

609
00:30:35,559 --> 00:30:36,359
Take a couple of steps?

610
00:30:43,599 --> 00:30:44,160
Come in.

611
00:30:47,319 --> 00:30:48,079
Officer.

612
00:30:49,160 --> 00:30:49,799
I...

613
00:30:50,039 --> 00:30:50,720
wanted to ask...

614
00:30:51,039 --> 00:30:51,759
about...

615
00:30:52,400 --> 00:30:53,960
that incident where the brewery sculpture was hit.

616
00:30:54,480 --> 00:30:55,640
You're from the brewery?

617
00:30:57,839 --> 00:30:59,079
The driver already admitted to it.

618
00:30:59,480 --> 00:31:01,319
We've already issued an administrative penalty.

619
00:31:02,039 --> 00:31:02,640
As for...

620
00:31:02,640 --> 00:31:03,759
that sculpture of yours,

621
00:31:03,960 --> 00:31:05,200
it falls under civil compensation.

622
00:31:05,480 --> 00:31:06,759
You'll have to file a civil lawsuit.

623
00:31:11,240 --> 00:31:12,119
Who hit it?

624
00:31:13,000 --> 00:31:13,799
Chen Qingchun.

625
00:31:14,039 --> 00:31:15,759
A retiree from your brewery.

626
00:31:16,400 --> 00:31:17,640
You have his contact info, right?

627
00:31:18,200 --> 00:31:18,640
Yeah.

628
00:31:19,039 --> 00:31:20,000
Then I don't need to give it to you.

629
00:31:20,079 --> 00:31:20,480
Off you go.

630
00:31:23,240 --> 00:31:23,960
Anything else?

631
00:31:24,799 --> 00:31:25,200
Nope.

632
00:31:25,599 --> 00:31:26,240
Then head on out.

633
00:31:26,400 --> 00:31:27,000
Close the door behind you.

634
00:31:30,759 --> 00:31:31,400
Go on.

635
00:32:00,759 --> 00:32:01,519
Let go!

636
00:32:02,359 --> 00:32:03,440
Let go of me!

637
00:32:21,720 --> 00:32:22,480
It's all your fault.

638
00:32:24,880 --> 00:32:26,079
Why did you even come back?

639
00:32:27,440 --> 00:32:28,960
Nothing good ever happens when you're back.

640
00:32:29,559 --> 00:32:32,720
You hauled that beat-up camera around, shooting everywhere.

641
00:32:33,240 --> 00:32:34,400
Where's all the stuff you shot?

642
00:32:35,279 --> 00:32:36,599
Why didn't you just show it?

643
00:32:36,920 --> 00:32:38,880
If you had, none of this would've happened!

644
00:33:04,680 --> 00:33:06,599
Where were you when Qian Yichuan was looking for you?

645
00:33:08,759 --> 00:33:10,240
You were nowhere to be found!

646
00:33:11,839 --> 00:33:13,519
When someone needs you, you disappear.

647
00:33:13,960 --> 00:33:16,079
When nobody wants you, you scurry all over!

648
00:33:16,240 --> 00:33:17,599
Showing up everywhere!

649
00:33:21,519 --> 00:33:23,359
What kind of scumbag are you?

650
00:33:23,960 --> 00:33:25,519
Why did you come back to torment us?

651
00:33:25,559 --> 00:33:27,119
Why torment us?!

652
00:33:42,079 --> 00:33:43,039
Don't sit there.

653
00:33:43,240 --> 00:33:43,799
It's cold.

654
00:33:46,240 --> 00:33:47,160
Let's talk inside.

655
00:33:47,839 --> 00:33:48,400
All right?

656
00:33:54,640 --> 00:33:55,200
Come on.

657
00:34:17,440 --> 00:34:17,760
Here.

658
00:34:18,800 --> 00:34:19,599
Eat something warm.

659
00:34:29,840 --> 00:34:30,880
We're not done yet.

660
00:34:31,639 --> 00:34:32,800
Don't think buying me food

661
00:34:32,800 --> 00:34:33,880
will shut me up.

662
00:34:35,320 --> 00:34:36,039
Fine.

663
00:34:37,239 --> 00:34:38,800
We live close to each other anyway.

664
00:34:39,159 --> 00:34:40,119
Whenever you want to yell at me,

665
00:34:40,159 --> 00:34:40,960
just knock on my door.

666
00:34:46,079 --> 00:34:47,079
I'm too tired to curse right now.

667
00:34:48,159 --> 00:34:49,239
Let me catch my breath first.

668
00:34:55,039 --> 00:34:55,760
There's something...

669
00:34:56,639 --> 00:34:57,519
I still think

670
00:34:58,480 --> 00:34:59,719
it's safer to tell you.

671
00:35:01,000 --> 00:35:02,440
I bet before Qian Yichuan passed away,

672
00:35:02,519 --> 00:35:03,599
he wanted to tell you about this, too.

673
00:35:05,039 --> 00:35:05,679
What is it?

674
00:35:06,760 --> 00:35:07,639
It's about Liu Xuemei.

675
00:35:10,840 --> 00:35:12,039
I haven't been sleeping well lately.

676
00:35:13,480 --> 00:35:14,440
Every time I close my eyes,

677
00:35:15,599 --> 00:35:16,519
I see her face.

678
00:35:21,039 --> 00:35:22,719
When I go through the discarded footage,

679
00:35:23,320 --> 00:35:24,360
I often see her, too.

680
00:35:30,199 --> 00:35:31,000
You know how she was.

681
00:35:31,159 --> 00:35:32,639
She hadn't been at the plant long,

682
00:35:33,760 --> 00:35:34,920
but she made quite a name for herself.

683
00:35:37,199 --> 00:35:38,679
Lots of guys in the factory had eyes for her,

684
00:35:39,800 --> 00:35:40,920
but none of them were good enough for her.

685
00:35:42,519 --> 00:35:43,880
I think she definitely had someone on the side.

686
00:35:45,639 --> 00:35:46,719
How do you know?

687
00:35:47,880 --> 00:35:49,760
She went to the phone booth every day to make calls.

688
00:35:51,199 --> 00:35:52,599
As a Beer Taster,

689
00:35:53,039 --> 00:35:53,960
she couldn't even drink alcohol.

690
00:35:54,800 --> 00:35:56,360
Yet every time she got off the phone,

691
00:35:56,880 --> 00:35:58,000
her cheeks were flushed,

692
00:35:58,079 --> 00:35:58,880
looking radiant as ever.

693
00:36:01,719 --> 00:36:04,199
You think she was calling a lover?

694
00:36:04,440 --> 00:36:05,880
Whether it was a lover, I don't know.

695
00:36:06,679 --> 00:36:07,840
But looking at her eyes,

696
00:36:07,840 --> 00:36:09,159
she was definitely calling a man.

697
00:36:10,599 --> 00:36:11,480
Who was that guy?

698
00:36:13,239 --> 00:36:14,920
I'm not a cop, how would I know?

699
00:36:18,480 --> 00:36:20,119
But I heard the calls were to Qingzhou.

700
00:36:22,039 --> 00:36:22,719
Qingzhou?

701
00:36:23,559 --> 00:36:25,079
I took a cab here from Qingzhou.

702
00:37:37,840 --> 00:37:38,400
Haipeng.

703
00:37:39,039 --> 00:37:39,960
Are you free right now?

704
00:37:41,400 --> 00:37:42,320
Well, strictly speaking...

705
00:37:42,400 --> 00:37:43,039
Of course I am.

706
00:37:43,559 --> 00:37:44,199
Back then,

707
00:37:44,800 --> 00:37:46,599
to welcome the millennium,

708
00:37:46,840 --> 00:37:49,679
they held a province-wide contest with prizes.

709
00:37:52,119 --> 00:37:52,519
Look.

710
00:37:53,159 --> 00:37:54,079
I told you so.

711
00:37:55,280 --> 00:37:56,239
Hold on, let me take a look.

712
00:37:57,280 --> 00:37:58,119
There's no name on it.

713
00:37:58,440 --> 00:37:59,679
Look, it just says "Qingzhou."

714
00:38:03,559 --> 00:38:04,159
Qingzhou?

715
00:38:05,719 --> 00:38:06,239
Hey,

716
00:38:06,679 --> 00:38:08,599
do you think the submitter

717
00:38:08,800 --> 00:38:10,119
was Liu Xuemei's lover?

718
00:38:11,880 --> 00:38:13,360
To paint her on a beer label,

719
00:38:13,559 --> 00:38:14,760
and make it look so beautiful...

720
00:38:15,400 --> 00:38:16,320
It's very likely.

721
00:38:18,960 --> 00:38:20,559
This lover was from Qingzhou.

722
00:38:22,159 --> 00:38:24,599
Gao Xuelin's father, Gao Wusong,

723
00:38:24,800 --> 00:38:26,079
was from Qingzhou, too.

724
00:38:27,960 --> 00:38:29,880
Could there have been

725
00:38:30,320 --> 00:38:32,079
a romantic relationship between them?

726
00:38:35,280 --> 00:38:37,440
Then Gao Xuelin's connection to this case

727
00:38:37,960 --> 00:38:38,880
becomes clear.

728
00:38:40,719 --> 00:38:42,079
Could it really be that coincidental?

729
00:38:43,599 --> 00:38:44,599
It's no coincidence.

730
00:38:45,480 --> 00:38:47,199
Gao Xuelin is the one

731
00:38:47,440 --> 00:38:48,559
who stitched all this together.

732
00:38:51,840 --> 00:38:54,519
Regardless of whether Gao Wusong painted it,

733
00:38:54,880 --> 00:38:55,239
hey,

734
00:38:55,719 --> 00:38:57,199
don't you think it's kind of romantic?

735
00:38:58,840 --> 00:39:00,599
Romance is a fleeting feeling,

736
00:39:01,320 --> 00:39:02,800
and feelings don't last.

737
00:39:03,599 --> 00:39:05,280
Then why did you get divorced back then?

738
00:39:07,559 --> 00:39:08,400
What are you talking about?

739
00:39:08,840 --> 00:39:09,599
Where are your manners?

740
00:39:14,639 --> 00:39:15,920
My ex-husband is a good man.

741
00:39:17,159 --> 00:39:17,960
It was my fault.

742
00:39:20,559 --> 00:39:21,920
His current wife

743
00:39:22,559 --> 00:39:23,519
is really nice, too.

744
00:39:26,119 --> 00:39:26,679
I just hope

745
00:39:28,400 --> 00:39:29,760
good things happen to good people.

746
00:39:33,480 --> 00:39:34,840
Why am I telling you this?

747
00:39:38,559 --> 00:39:39,559
Look, we've come this far.

748
00:39:39,840 --> 00:39:40,760
Couldn't we...

749
00:39:41,079 --> 00:39:42,360
leave out Gao Xuelin's name for now

750
00:39:42,360 --> 00:39:43,320
and publish part of it first?

751
00:39:44,880 --> 00:39:45,800
Remember this:

752
00:39:46,440 --> 00:39:47,480
with this case,

753
00:39:47,719 --> 00:39:48,840
we can't rush.

754
00:39:49,480 --> 00:39:51,679
Right now, we're only at the suspicion stage.

755
00:39:52,079 --> 00:39:53,559
What if we have no solid evidence?

756
00:39:53,719 --> 00:39:55,559
Just take things out of context and distort facts?

757
00:39:55,559 --> 00:39:57,679
But in journalism, every second counts.

758
00:39:57,880 --> 00:39:59,800
If we're late, we'll just be eating their dust.

759
00:40:00,679 --> 00:40:02,440
We move when we have enough evidence.

760
00:40:02,840 --> 00:40:04,079
Now is not the time.

761
00:40:36,280 --> 00:40:37,039
Liu Xiaosheng?

762
00:40:39,840 --> 00:40:40,480
That's me.

763
00:40:41,000 --> 00:40:41,920
And you are?

764
00:40:42,000 --> 00:40:42,599
Hello.

765
00:40:42,960 --> 00:40:43,920
I'm Shen Leshui.

766
00:40:44,760 --> 00:40:46,480
I made the documentary *Malt Kingdom*.

767
00:40:47,119 --> 00:40:48,480
I interviewed your mother back then.

768
00:40:49,679 --> 00:40:50,880
I called you yesterday,

769
00:40:51,400 --> 00:40:52,079
but you didn't answer.

770
00:40:53,519 --> 00:40:53,920
Right.

771
00:40:56,840 --> 00:40:57,920
May I sit here?

772
00:41:04,400 --> 00:41:05,360
What is this about?

773
00:41:05,880 --> 00:41:06,719
My shuttle is coming soon.

774
00:41:09,159 --> 00:41:11,159
The recent murder at the old Lapi Brewery...

775
00:41:12,199 --> 00:41:13,000
Have you heard about it?

776
00:41:14,800 --> 00:41:15,400
Haven't paid attention.

777
00:41:20,280 --> 00:41:21,000
I wanted to

778
00:41:23,000 --> 00:41:24,119
ask about your mother.

779
00:41:29,119 --> 00:41:29,800
I heard

780
00:41:30,519 --> 00:41:31,840
that before she died,

781
00:41:31,960 --> 00:41:33,079
she took a trip to Qingzhou.

782
00:41:34,079 --> 00:41:35,320
Do you know why?

783
00:41:37,440 --> 00:41:38,400
I was only eight back then.

784
00:41:39,119 --> 00:41:39,800
Where she went,

785
00:41:40,679 --> 00:41:41,400
I really don't know.

786
00:41:43,440 --> 00:41:45,400
Did anyone in your family

787
00:41:45,960 --> 00:41:47,320
ever ask about the autopsy?

788
00:41:49,360 --> 00:41:50,320
The grown-ups might have.

789
00:41:51,079 --> 00:41:51,840
I don't remember.

790
00:41:55,199 --> 00:41:57,519
December 31st, 1999.

791
00:41:57,960 --> 00:41:59,800
It snowed heavily that day.

792
00:42:00,159 --> 00:42:01,360
Your mother went to attend a—

793
00:42:01,360 --> 00:42:02,119
I don't have

794
00:42:02,119 --> 00:42:03,079
any good feelings towards the people at Lapi Brewery.

795
00:42:03,840 --> 00:42:04,559
After what happened,

796
00:42:04,880 --> 00:42:06,320
they were all badmouthing my mom.

797
00:42:07,400 --> 00:42:08,480
The things they said

798
00:42:09,119 --> 00:42:10,559
were as nasty as could be.

799
00:42:12,280 --> 00:42:13,599
I was just a seven or eight-year-old kid.

800
00:42:14,440 --> 00:42:15,159
I didn't understand

801
00:42:15,159 --> 00:42:16,519
why people cursed my mom like that.

802
00:42:17,400 --> 00:42:18,280
I didn't want to hear it,

803
00:42:18,880 --> 00:42:19,760
so I fought them.

804
00:42:21,199 --> 00:42:22,239
But I couldn't beat them.

805
00:42:24,039 --> 00:42:24,639
Later,

806
00:42:25,280 --> 00:42:26,639
I was sent to my grandma's.

807
00:42:27,800 --> 00:42:28,840
These past dozen years,

808
00:42:29,400 --> 00:42:30,280
I've been doing fine.

809
00:42:31,400 --> 00:42:31,920
But if you

810
00:42:31,920 --> 00:42:33,519
insist on asking me about the brewery...

811
00:42:35,360 --> 00:42:36,039
I know nothing.

812
00:42:36,079 --> 00:42:36,719
Sorry.

813
00:42:37,559 --> 00:42:38,360
I have to catch my shuttle.

814
00:42:39,800 --> 00:42:41,599
I... I just have one more question.

815
00:42:43,639 --> 00:42:45,159
Do you know Gao Wusong?

816
00:42:46,239 --> 00:42:48,199
He's a cab driver in Qingzhou.

817
00:42:50,960 --> 00:42:51,599
Don't know him.

818
00:43:03,400 --> 00:43:05,440
Gao Xuelin's father

819
00:43:05,519 --> 00:43:08,719
was Liu Xuemei's lover in Qingzhou.

820
00:43:09,360 --> 00:43:10,280
So are you saying

821
00:43:11,039 --> 00:43:12,400
that cop named Gao

822
00:43:12,840 --> 00:43:14,280
stole the tape for his father?

823
00:43:15,400 --> 00:43:16,400
Not just the tape.

824
00:43:16,920 --> 00:43:18,199
He probably committed murder, too.

825
00:43:22,039 --> 00:43:23,679
He should be under investigation right now, right?

826
00:43:24,519 --> 00:43:25,360
Just now,

827
00:43:26,519 --> 00:43:27,360
I checked your public account,

828
00:43:27,920 --> 00:43:29,400
and it says "murderer."
